graph TB
    subgraph "Startup instructions and explicitly read notes"
        L1[L1: AGENTS.md + optional rule notes]
        L1R[Rules & Gotchas]
        L1I[Identity & Preferences]
        L1C[Credential references]
        L1 --> L1R
        L1 --> L1I
        L1 --> L1C
    end

    subgraph "On Demand ($wiki query)"
        L2[L2: Logseq / Obsidian Wiki]
        L2P[Projects & History]
        L2W[Workflows & Processes]
        L2K[Research & Learning]
        L2 --> L2P
        L2 --> L2W
        L2 --> L2K
    end

    NEW[New Knowledge] --> ROUTE{Quick rule<br/>or gotcha?}
    ROUTE -->|Yes| L1
    ROUTE -->|No| L2

    USER[User Query] --> CODEX[Codex]
    CODEX --> L1
    CODEX -->|Deep question| L2
